{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000970/extras/a36326b67489f89e71c2e16ab277ed58.avif?t=1764729151\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The \u2018rusty ones\u2019 roam the dead lands of a world left in ruins after their failed revolution. As humanity teeters on the edge of extinction, you must help the last survivors find a way to escape. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Beacon of Neyda</i></strong> is a action-strategy game where you build and defend your base against relentless waves of enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000970/extras/8fbcb8caa5ba6aa0319c718b39065216.poster.avif?t=1764729151\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000970/extras/8fbcb8caa5ba6aa0319c718b39065216.webm?t=1764729151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000970/extras/8fbcb8caa5ba6aa0319c718b39065216.mp4?t=1764729151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repair the main tower in every base to win. Each base creates a safe space, but be careful, fighting alone is not always the best option. Defend yourself and protect the core of your base at all cost!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000970/extras/2ad6dc6e7ea51c983edea558fadc0fe8.poster.avif?t=1764729151\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000970/extras/2ad6dc6e7ea51c983edea558fadc0fe8.webm?t=1764729151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000970/extras/2ad6dc6e7ea51c983edea558fadc0fe8.mp4?t=1764729151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore different abandoned locations and be careful, as your surroundings can also be dangerous. Research new technologies to improve your constructions and discover the history behind this world, its truths and its lies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000970/extras/ab9ff9a0de24eaa8b48b61dd1d435fe2.poster.avif?t=1764729151\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000970/extras/ab9ff9a0de24eaa8b48b61dd1d435fe2.webm?t=1764729151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000970/extras/ab9ff9a0de24eaa8b48b61dd1d435fe2.mp4?t=1764729151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Beacon of Neyda you are the last hope of this world\u2026 Are you up to the challenge? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000970/extras/f99ecf750734f82e3b32bd059f2bdf52.poster.avif?t=1764729151\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000970/extras/f99ecf750734f82e3b32bd059f2bdf52.webm?t=1764729151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000970/extras/f99ecf750734f82e3b32bd059f2bdf52.mp4?t=1764729151\" t